WEBVTT

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:58.550
Lilan's...  Lilan's...

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:06.520
Kazalm's Oath

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:27.160
All right, Lilan, time for your walk.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:14.050
So?  Doesn't it feel good?

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.360
I can't believe how well it's doing.

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:57.340
Did you know what it was trying to say?

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:05.800
No.  I only know the wild beast-lords make a similar noise, so I just mimicked the sound.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:20.480
Beast-lords like to keep themselves clean, so it must be taking a bath.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.300
It won't drown?

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.620
That river is shallow, so you don't have to worry.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.830
All right.  Clean up the shed while Lilan's outside.

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:53.550
Erin!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.980
Let's begin the meeting.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.430
It's those two.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:24.990
Hey, Kashugan.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.350
Don't you think those two are getting along well?

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:32.380
A hot guy and a hot girl.  A perfect match.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:38.850
I guess Tomura-senpai lost to Erin when it came to the beast-lord.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.980
Hey!  Don't be ridiculous!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.240
There's no way Tomura-senpai would lose!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.170
But she succeeded in feeding Lilan.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:52.840
She's of the Mist People, so she could have used a trick that was passed down from them.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:57.720
He's right.  Otherwise you can't explain how she was able to feed the beast-lord.

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.500
Don't be stupid!

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:02.060
Erin isn't like that!

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:13.460
Are you aware of the rumor that's spreading amongst the students?

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:14.510
What rumor?

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:21.050
That the Mist girl used a secret technique to control Lilan.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:26.150
I'll hear your questions and comments later.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.790
Allow me to first explain the situation here first.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:38.470
When Lilan first came here, it was terribly afraid of light, and would not even eat, or drink benetrophic water.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:43.680
If it had continued in that condition, it would have endangered its own life,

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:46.260
and we didn't have a way of saving it.

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:57.700
The reason I put her in charge of taking care of Lilan is not because she's of the Mist People,

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:03.100
but because she was brought up and studied under Jone, who was the Reverend of the Teachers at Tamuyuan,

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:08.200
and had the experience of observing a wild beast-lord.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:17.830
Erin was the first to realize the reason why Lilan was afraid of the light, and sought permission to take a plank off the wall.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:24.790
For a baby beast-lord dwelling in a cave beneath their mother, light naturally comes by their feet.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:33.870
She realized that a bright light from above signified to it that its mother was gone.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.760
What a story.

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:40.160
She's got quite the imagination.

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:49.420
Until she brought it up, I never considered the angle of light.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:55.200
But rather than a difference in imagination, I'd say it's a difference in knowledge.

00:07:55.710 --> 00:08:01.150
Does anybody here know how a family of wild beast-lords dwell?

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:03.410
No, we don't.

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:08.210
None of us have been to places where wild beast-lords would be living.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.840
<i>Beast-Lord Imperatives.</i>

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:24.160
We who take care of the Queen's precious beast-lords are mandated to raise them according to what's written here.

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:44.310
It's sleeping peacefully.

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:56.310
You really did make Lilan eat the food, didn't you?

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:01.980
You've done something I couldn't do no matter what I tried, so easily.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:06.970
Even if you had used a secret technique of the Mist People-

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:09.060
I didn't use anything like that!

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:13.040
I know.  Listen to me until the end.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:20.030
What I want to say is, even if you had used a secret technique of the Mist People, I would respect you.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:25.530
You've thought of nothing but Lilan these past 12 days.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:32.570
I think that led to the ideas you've had which deviate from the <i>Beast-Lord Imperatives</i>.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.410
"Beast-Lord Imperatives?"

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:45.110
In <i>Beast-Lord Imperatives</i> are the rules which everyone in the Beast-Lord Care Centers must abide by absolutely.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:53.290
Because going against it could be taken as betrayal against our Queen, who is symbolized by the beast-lord.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:04.800
What happens if you go against the Beast-Lord Imperatives?

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.270
You would meet severe punishment.

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.360
Don't worry!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.690
I will protect you!

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:37.400
Thank you very much.  I'm fine.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:44.740
A-After all, Esal-sensei told me to look out for you.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:06.440
Being only in the 2nd year of Junior High, Erin doesn't know yet what the Beast-Lord Imperatives are.

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:10.940
Honestly, it gave me goosebumps.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:22.240
Without using the mute whistle, but instead using her harp, she created a sound similar to its mother's voice,

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:25.010
and fed Lilan.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.230
The reason why I had you all gather today is

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:52.190
to debate if we should report the fact that Erin is communicating without using the mute whistle but with a harp,

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:55.330
to the palace or not.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:59.440
We must make our thoughts clear on this.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.850
Erin's getting kicked out?!

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:28.400
What did she do to get kicked out?!

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.810
Erin's done something incredible!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.380
Yeah.  It makes me want to boast over what Erin achieved.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.270
Yeah.  People should be rewarding her.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.850
Do you really think so?

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.680
Think about it.

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:48.870
As the old tales tell us, only the Queen can command a beast-lord.

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:58.500
Je, the Founding King who came down from Ephon Noha, brought peace to this land with beast-lords under His command.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:09.300
Yaman Hasal was given the whistle for Touda, and became victorious against Hajan.

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.070
As a result, we have the present.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:14.990
I know that story!

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:18.780
The beast-lords eat Touda in that story, right?

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:19.910
Yes.

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:27.570
That's why the Queen, who has the control over beast-lords, is so much more influential than the Grand Duke, who controls the Touda.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:31.580
Then what about Erin who controlled Lilan?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:34.580
You want to say she's as influential as the Queen?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.790
That wasn't my point.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.660
Of course not.  That can't be true.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:48.570
"Beast-lords never befriend humans."

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:55.010
But Erin has completely disproved that theory.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:59.860
Isn't that why we should report the matter to the palace soon?

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:03.820
But reporting this to the palace will create great turmoil.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:10.560
The Kazalm Academy might be punished for not following the codes as well.

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:17.560
With an honest and sincere wish for Lilan to get better,

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:23.010
Erin spent her nights at the shed, and brought about a wonderful outcome as a result.

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:27.390
It was something only she could have done.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:39.410
Both Tomura and I tried playing the harp, but Lilan would only listen to the sound and gave no reaction, as it would to Erin.

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:51.640
If we report these pure facts, I'm sure not many people will read it as the result of her efforts.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:15:00.580
Then they would begin linking her eye color and the fact that her mother was of the Mist People to this matter.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.810
But the truth is different.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:15.620
When I watch them, I think Erin has become a mother figure to Lilan.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:26.450
When Lilan was trapped in the darkness of anxiety, Erin was the one who gave it the warmth its mother used to give.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:16:02.770
Even if we simply look at how we feed the beast-lords, we're leaving the food in the shed while they're out.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:14.120
On days it's raining and we can't let them out, we place the food after we petrify them with the mute whistle.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:21.960
Having food placed while it's gone or getting the food placed before its eyes while petrified...

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:27.050
There's no way a baby would see us as a mother who feeds it.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:32.170
But the procedure of feeding them is dictated by the Beast-Lord Imperatives.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:37.010
It's part of our role to follow it and pass it on to the students.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:46.690
But it's also true that we've never made any intimate contact with beast-lords.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:51.950
Even though we've taken care of them for decades and have seen many of their last moments.

00:16:53.060 --> 00:17:00.090
Erin, who doesn't know of the Beast-Lord Imperatives, took care of Lilan as if she was dealing with a dog or a horse.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:07.670
As a result, she became the first in history to create a bond with a beast-lord.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:15.070
If the fact that some third person, someone other than the Queen, can control the beast-lord is released,

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:20.380
there will be people who will try to take advantage of her as a person who has a special power.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:25.650
When I think of that, I shiver with fear.

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:32.400
Here's the question again:

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:39.660
Do you think we should report what happened between Erin and Lilan to the palace?

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:03.560
During the day, I talked over many different things about you with the other teachers.

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:06.060
What did you talk about?

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:09.020
Hear me plainly.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:17.350
This country is at peace because the Grand Duke's army is protecting us from the neighboring country's force using Touda.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.060
You understand that, right?

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:20.560
Yes.

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:24.250
Now, beast-lords are the only creatures which eat Touda.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:31.380
If you become capable of controlling that beast-lord as you wish,

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:38.050
you become a person with political benefits to be close to, for those who are power hungry.

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:18.340
That's rubbish.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:19.840
"Rubbish?"

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:25.510
Beast-lords attack Touda only because that's what's in their nature.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.550
To use that as a tool in war...

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:30.260
I don't even want to think about it.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:33.590
I don't want Lilan caught up in something like that.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:38.760
I only want to raise Lilan like they are in the wild.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:47.820
So I don't want to make it drink benetrophic water, nor will I petrify it with a mute whistle.

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.500
Absolutely never.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:58.150
Very well.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:02.980
Follow me.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.300
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:31.500
I think Yassa-sensei spoke to you all just now,

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:41.940
but I plan to make what happened between Erin and Lilan a secret to be kept within the Kazalm Beast-lord Care Center.

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:48.720
If people find out what you've accomplished, they'd definitely take you away to Lazal.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:51.650
"Lazal?"

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:54.040
It's the official Beast-lord Care Center.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:58.690
If you go there, most likely, both your and Lilan's freedom will be gone.

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:05.740
Those of you who will swear on their oath to keep that secret, please rise.

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:54.290
We hereby swear... to protect you and Lilan.

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:01.200
Thank you very much.

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:06.540
Thank you very much, everyone.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:07.000
Ani-ue, do you remember the promise we made when we planted this tree?

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:10.060
Do you remember how we said that like our great ancestor Yaman Hasal,

00:24:10.060 --> 00:24:16.530
we'd use our strength for the Queen and the people of this country?

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:18.440
Yet now...

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:21.820
Ani-ue, you were always correct!

00:24:22.280 --> 00:24:25.090
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Song of Grief.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:30.070
Song of Grief
